#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:6
msgid "API Documentation"
msgstr "API 文档"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:9
msgid ""
"The API module provides a high-level abstraction layer for essential "
"system utilities. It consolidates system timing, power management (sleep "
"modes), and debug printing into a unified interface. The Print module "
"acts as a lightweight, formatted output utility that directs debug "
"messages to a configured UART instance."
msgstr ""
"API 模块为基本的系统工具提供了高级抽象层。它将系统计时、电源管理（睡眠模式）和调试打印整合到统一的接口中。Print 模块作为一个轻量级的格式化输出工具，将调试消息定向到已配置的 UART 实例。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:11
msgid "**Key Features:**"
msgstr "**主要特性：**"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:13
msgid "**System Timing:** Microsecond-precision timestamp generation."
msgstr "**系统计时：** 微秒级精度的时间戳生成。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:14
msgid ""
"**Power Management:** Unified sleep function with configurable power "
"modes (Suspend, Deep Sleep, Retention)."
msgstr ""
"**电源管理：** 统一的睡眠功能，支持可配置的电源模式（挂起、深度睡眠、保留）。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:15
msgid "**Debug Output:** `printf`-like formatting capability."
msgstr "**调试输出：** 类 `printf` 的格式化能力。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:16
msgid ""
"**UART Integration:** Directs debug output to a specific, user-"
"configurable UART hardware instance."
msgstr ""
"**UART 集成：** 将调试输出定向到用户可配置的特定 UART 硬件实例。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:18
msgid "API Reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:19
msgid ""
"This section describes the functions available in the API and Print "
"modules."
msgstr "本节描述 API 和 Print 模块中可用的函数。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:21
msgid "1. `tlk_api_micros`"
msgstr "1. `tlk_api_micros`"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:22
msgid ""
"Returns the current system up-time in microseconds. This function "
"utilizes the system timer (`stimer`) to calculate the tick count."
msgstr ""
"返回当前系统运行时间的微秒数。该函数使用系统定时器（`stimer`）计算计时器计数值。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:24
#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:43
#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:61
#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:81
msgid "**Prototype:**"
msgstr "**原型：**"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:30
msgid "**Parameters:** None"
msgstr "**参数：** 无"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:33
msgid ""
"**Return Value:** `uint32_t`: The number of microseconds passed since the"
" system started."
msgstr ""
"**返回值：** `uint32_t`：自系统启动以来经过的微秒数。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:36
msgid "2. `tlk_api_sleep`"
msgstr "2. `tlk_api_sleep`"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:37
msgid "*This API is available only if `CONFIG_TLK_API_SLEEP` is enabled.*"
msgstr "*此 API 仅在启用 `CONFIG_TLK_API_SLEEP` 时可用。*"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:39
msgid ""
"Checks duration; if zero — returns. If `CONFIG_TLK_PM` is enabled, it "
"calls `tlk_pm_sleep` with `TLK_PM_SLEEP_MAX_LEVEL-1` parameter. If "
"`CONFIG_TLK_PM` is disabled, or `tlk_pm_sleep` returned err, it programs "
"the timer for the requested delay, enables timer interrupt, and waits "
"using WFI."
msgstr ""
"检查延时时间，如果为零则直接返回。如果启用了 `CONFIG_TLK_PM`，则调用参数为 `TLK_PM_SLEEP_MAX_LEVEL-1` 的 `tlk_pm_sleep`。如果 `CONFIG_TLK_PM` 未启用，或 `tlk_pm_sleep` 返回错误，则编程定时器以请求延时，使能定时器中断，并通过 WFI 指令等待。"

