msgstr "*此 API 仅在启用 `CONFIG_TLK_DEBUG_PRINT` 时可用。*"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:79
msgid ""
"A formatted output function similar to the standard C `printf`. It "
"formats the string and transmits it via the configured UART interface."
msgstr ""
"一个类似于标准 C `printf` 的格式化输出函数。它格式化字符串并通过已配置的 UART 接口传输。"

