#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:94
msgid ""
"**Return Value:** `int`: The number of characters written to the output "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"**返回值：** `int`：写入输出缓冲区的字符数。"

#: ../../source/developing/public_api.md:97
msgid ""
"**Note:** This function uses an internal static buffer defined by "
"`CONFIG_TLK_DEBUG_PRINT_BUFFER_SIZE`. Ensure your formatted message does "
"not exceed this limit. This function is used internally by the SDK and "
"may not have a public declaration in API headers."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 此函数使用由 `CONFIG_TLK_DEBUG_PRINT_BUFFER_SIZE` 定义的内部静态缓冲区。请确保格式化的消息不超过此限制。此函数由 SDK 内部使用，可能在 API 头文件中没有公开声明。"
